              "printed_rules_text": "**Mentor** _(You may only have Sutcliffe in your deck if your hero is young.)_\r\nAt the start of your turn, if Sutcliffe is face down in your arsenal, you may turn him face up.\r\nWhenever you play a 'non-attack' action card, deal 1 arcane damage to each hero and put a lesson counter on Sutcliffe for each damage dealt this way. Then if there are 3 or more lesson counters on Sutcliffe, banish him, search your deck for a **specialization** card, put it face up into your arsenal, and shuffle your deck.",
